{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Better</b> — for those who rule their spirit, much [so], than a dry morsel in which there is tranquility." "<b>Than a house full of sacrificial portions [with] strife</b> — and strife, that they are always angry."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:15.416303855Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}